          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for updates to the Victoza labeling to expand the approved age range of patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus to 10 years and older to reflect the results of the, \"Efficacy and safety of liraglutide in combination with metformin versus metformin monotherapy on glycaemic control in children and adolescents with type 2 diabetes - A 26-week double-blind, randomised, parallel group, placebo controlled multi-centre trial followed by a 26-week open-label extension,\" to fulfill the requirements of a Written Request issued by FDA to Novo Nordisk Inc. dated September 19, 2012, amended January 15, 2015, and March 20, 2017.",
